1.51:
  Managed Identity [PREVIEW]
  - New `managed-identity` noun supports configuring Power Platform Managed Identity (PPMI) for supported components (e.g., plugins, SharePoint, etc.).
    - Verbs `create`, `update`, `delete`, and `get` support CRUD operations.
    - Verbs `show-fic`, `configure-fic`, and `verify-fic` configure Federated Identity Credentials for Entra apps and user-assigned managed identities associated with PPMI.
    - All verbs require the `--component-type` and `--component-id` parameters.

  copilot:
    - `mcp` command now supports `--run` argument to start a MCP server with new .Net 10 `dnx` command: `dnx Microsoft.PowerApps.CLI.Tool --yes copilot mcp --run`

